    <selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="Alvarex Maun" hidden="true" id="r41-unit-xix-5-alvarex-maun">
      <rules><rule id="r43-maun-wg" name="Wargear" hidden="false"><description>Artificer Armour, Refractor Field, Bolt Pistol, Tolaedus, Nightfall Pattern Strato-Vox and Frag Grenades.</description></rule><rule id="r43-maun-vox" name="Nightfall Pattern Strato-Vox" hidden="false"><description>Counts as a Nuncio Vox. Once during each Raven Guard turn, one friendly Raven Guard unit deploying by Deep Strike with its first model within 12 inches of Maun may re-roll the dice rolled for scatter distance; the second result is accepted.</description></rule><rule id="r43-maun-command" name="Command Squad" hidden="false"><description>Alvarex Maun may be accompanied by a Legion Command Squad. Maun and the Command Squad count as a single HQ selection.</description></rule></rules><infoLinks><infoLink id="r41-unit-xix-5-alvarex-maun-rg-leg" name="Legiones Astartes (Raven Guard)" targetId="r43-rg-legiones-astartes-raven-guard" type="rule" hidden="false" /><infoLink id="r41-unit-xix-5-alvarex-maun-rg-surgical-strike" name="Surgical Strike" targetId="r43-rg-surgical-strike" type="rule" hidden="false" /><infoLink id="r41-unit-xix-5-alvarex-maun-rg-rapid-reaction" name="Rapid Reaction" targetId="r43-rg-rapid-reaction" type="rule" hidden="false" /><infoLink id="r41-unit-xix-5-alvarex-maun-rg-shadow-masters" name="Shadow Masters" targetId="r43-rg-shadow-masters" type="rule" hidden="false" /><infoLink id="r41-unit-xix-5-alvarex-maun-rg-limited-vehicles" name="Limited Vehicles" targetId="r43-rg-limited-vehicles" type="rule" hidden="false" /><infoLink id="r41-unit-xix-5-alvarex-maun-master-of-the-legion" name="Master of the Legion" targetId="r36-shared-master-of-the-legion-a3a88da" type="rule" hidden="false" /><infoLink id="r41-unit-xix-5-alvarex-maun-independent-character" name="Independent Character" targetId="r36-shared-independent-character-4fbd2ae" type="rule" hidden="false" /><infoLink id="r41-unit-xix-5-alvarex-maun-master-of-descent" name="Master of Descent" targetId="r43-rg-master-